# Recent additions, one scene each: brackets that close themselves,
# snippets, a folder edited as text, Greed's agent writing a plugin that is
# loaded once installed, the outline, the command picker's descriptions,
# and a Markdown file shown as slides, a block running on one.
# The model is scripted in the demo profile.
size 1280 800
fps 30
typing 0.03
show-keys
hide
keys :
type open src/worker.rs
keys enter
wait-for ATTEMPTS
keys g e
show
wait 0.8

caption Brackets and quotes close as you type
keys o enter
type let pairs = vec![(1, "one")];
wait 1.2

caption A snippet: tab goes to the next place to fill in
keys enter enter
type tst
wait 1
keys enter
wait 0.8
type retries
keys tab
type ATTEMPTS
keys tab
type 3
wait 0.6
keys tab esc
wait 1.2

caption A folder as text: change a name, save, confirm
keys space -
wait 1
keys /
type server
keys enter
wait 0.6
keys c
type api
keys esc
wait 0.8
keys :
type w
keys enter
wait 1.5
keys y
wait 1.5
keys :
type folder-undo
keys enter
wait 1

caption Asked for a command, the agent writes a plugin and checks it
keys space b
type worker
keys enter
keys space i n
type Greed
keys enter
type project
keys enter
wait 0.6
type Add a command that upper-cases the line I'm on, on alt-u while typing.
wait 0.4
keys alt-enter
wait-for Install upcase
wait 0.6
caption Installing it is up to you
wait 2
keys a
wait-for Installed and loaded
wait 1.2

caption Loaded right away
keys esc
keys ctrl-w h
keys /
type let pairs
keys enter
keys i
wait 0.6
keys alt-u
wait 1.2
keys esc
wait 0.6

caption The outline: what each thing is, and its line
keys :
type open src/orders.rs
keys enter
wait 0.6
keys space s
wait 2
keys esc
wait 0.4

caption The command picker shows the current command's description in full
keys space ?
type agent
wait 0.8
keys down
wait 2.2
keys esc
wait 0.6

caption A Markdown file is a slide deck
keys :
type open talk.md
keys enter
wait 0.6
keys space m P
wait 2

caption Its blocks run on the slide
keys right
wait 1
keys r
wait 0.6
keys y
wait 2

caption The presenter's view: the notes, the next slide and the time
keys q
wait 0.3
keys :
type slides-presenter
keys enter
wait 2.5
keys right
wait 1.5
keys q
wait 0.6

caption greed.rs
wait 1.5
